  "description": "What the React apps on fieldtec-web share: the API client, Elasticsearch helpers, the data layer (session, searches, records), the UI kit and page components, the app shell, base styles, and the dev, Vite and end-to-end tooling. TypeScript source, used as is (no build step).",
